Upstream Gliff
--------------

gliff-win depends on three upstream crates, pinned to commit
58c742452ded3f10a2ce61f60eb4845f18205e29: gliff-proto, gliff-transport and
gliff-sw. Upstream Gliff is MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2026 Kevin
McConnell; the license text is in LICENSE.

The following files are ports of, or follow closely, upstream Gliff source
(crates/gliff, crates/gliff-sw and crates/gliff-server at that commit), and
carry the upstream copyright notice through LICENSE:

  crates/gliff-windows/src/cursor.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/cursor_image.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/decode.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/layout.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/layout/tests.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/link.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/present.hlsl
  crates/gliff-windows/src/present_math.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/present_math/tests.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/resize_gate.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/resize_gate/tests.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/session/driver.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/session/machine.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/session/machine/tests.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/ssh.rs
  crates/gliff-windows/src/yuv.rs
  crates/gwin-verify/src/bin/gwin-fake-server/main.rs
  crates/gwin-verify/src/bin/gwin-fake-server/model.rs

keycodemapdb
------------

crates/gliff-windows/src/keymap.rs (its scan code to evdev table) and the test
fixture crates/gliff-windows/tests/fixtures/set1-evdev.tsv are generated from
the keycodemapdb key code data (https://gitlab.com/keycodemap/keycodemapdb),
used under its BSD-3-Clause option. Its notice is kept in
crates/gliff-windows/tests/fixtures/set1-evdev.NOTICE.

